error[elab/hole-outside-hint-unsupported]: hole is not allowed outside a hint
  ┌─ elab/type-hole-outside-hint.watsup:5:10
  │
4 │ dec $f : nat
  │          --- return value of function '$f' expects 'nat'
5 │ def $f = %0
